  '🍜 地域の食・横丁': ['🍜 Local food and yokocho', '🍜 Comida local e yokocho'],
  '🎨 D-K・祭り・夜間滞在': ['🎨 D-K, festivals, and evening visits', '🎨 D-K, festivais e visitas noturnas'],
  '♨️ 温泉・宿泊': ['♨️ Onsen and overnight stays', '♨️ Onsen e hospedagem'],
  '✈️ 空港・新幹線からの周遊': ['✈️ Connections from the airport and Shinkansen', '✈️ Conexões a partir do aeroporto e do Shinkansen'],
